        "original_id": "94693772-4ad6-5591-9d52-0aac6b6d82c5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Chippiparai, King Shepherd\n- Places: Periyar Lake\n- Concepts: dog breed origins, crossbreeding\n\nFacts:\n- The Chippiparai is thought to be a descendant of the Saluki or Sloughi.\n- The Chippiparai is today found in the area around Periyar Lake.\n- The King Shepherd is a dog breed developed in the 1990s.\n- The King Shepherd was developed by crossing the German Shepherd Dog with the Shiloh Shepherd, long-coated European lines of German Shepherd, and the Great Pyrenees.",
